{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q61184","formula":"C₂₄H₄₀N₅O₈","hill":"C24H40N5O8","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":24.0,"H":40.0,"N":5.0,"O":8.0},"names":{"en":"Desmosine","ru":"Десмозин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Desmosine is an amino acid found uniquely in elastin, a protein found in connective tissue such as skin, lungs, and elastic arteries. Desmosine is a component of elastin and cross links with its isomer, isodesmosine, giving elasticity to the tissue. Detection of desmosine in urine, plasma or sputum samples can be a marker for elastin breakdown due to high elastase activity related to certain diseases.","ru":"Десмозин (от др.-греч. δεσμός — связка) — аминокислота, производное 4 остатков лизина (образуется в ходе посттрансляционных модификаций). Содержится в белке эластине."},"fame":19,"pubchemCid":15942890,"mass":526.6,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=C(C(=C(C=[N+]1CCCC[C@@H](C(=O)O)N)CC[C@@H](C(=O)O)N)CCC[C@@H](C(=O)O)N)CC[C@@H](C(=O)O)N","inchikey":"VEVRNHHLCPGNDU-MUGJNUQGSA-O","iupac":"(2S)-2-amino-6-[4-[(4S)-4-amino-4-carboxybutyl]-3,5-bis[(3S)-3-amino-3-carboxypropyl]pyridin-1-ium-1-yl]hexanoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"15942890","atoms":77,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.124,"y":1.163,"z":-0.25,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.221,"y":0.885,"z":-0.518,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.902,"y":-0.037,"z":0.305,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.212,"y":-0.59,"z":1.407,"el":"C"},{"x":1.117,"y":-0.223,"z":1.635,"el":"C"},{"x":1.765,"y":0.615,"z":0.801,"el":"N"},{"x":3.181,"y":0.974,"z":1.067,"el":"C"},{"x":4.112,"y":-0.191,"z":0.738,"el":"C"},{"x":4.152,"y":-0.606,"z":-0.737,"el":"C"},{"x":4.619,"y":0.47,"z":-1.727,"el":"C"},{"x":6.005,"y":1.069,"z":-1.453,"el":"C"},{"x":7.113,"y":0.023,"z":-1.63,"el":"C"},{"x":7.347,"y":-0.892,"z":-0.856,"el":"O"